{"parse": {"title": "衣着/尝鲜调查员", "pageid": 55584, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"character-skin-page\"><div class=\"character-base-info\"><div class=\"character-img-box0 tabber\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div class=\"character-img-box1\"><div class=\"tabber-item hide-m\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-tabberimg=\"Skin_bg-304104.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit-height\" style=\"position:absolute; right:0; height:100%;display:none;\"></div><div class=\"character-img-box2\"><img alt=\"Zhujiemian you di.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bc/Zhujiemian_you_di.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"508\" height=\"612\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" data-file-width=\"508\" data-file-height=\"612\" /></div><div class=\"character-img-box2 tabber-item\" data-id=\"304104\" data-isl2d=\"0\" data-tabberimg=\"Portrait-304104.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit\" data-tabberimglink=\"File:Portrait-304104.webp\"></div><div class=\"character-img-box2 tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-tabberimg=\"L2d_static-304104_mded.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit\" data-tabberimglink=\"File:L2d_static-304104_mded.webp\" style=\"display:none;\"></div></div><div class=\"character-desc-offset\"><div class=\"character-img-button-group\"><div class=\"tabber-filter l2d-button-group\"><div class=\"l2d-button\"><img alt=\"Btm lihui.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/4d/Btm_lihui.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"84\" data-file-height=\"84\" /></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"0\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-type=\"isl2d\">L2D</div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-isl2d=\"0\" data-type=\"isl2d\">立绘</div></div></div></div><div class=\"img-desc img-desc-only\" style=\"position:relative; padding-bottom:25px\">炉窑热情，烤盘滋滋作响——调查报告新鲜出炉，亟待处理！</div><div class=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-304104 mded.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b7/Spine_static-304104_mded.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"157\" height=\"447\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"157\" data-file-height=\"447\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3041\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8E%9B%E8%92%82%E5%B0%94%E8%BE%BE\" title=\"玛蒂尔达\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8E%9B%E8%92%82%E5%B0%94%E8%BE%BE\" title=\"玛蒂尔达\"><img alt=\"玛蒂尔达\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8E%9B%E8%92%82%E5%B0%94%E8%BE%BE\" title=\"玛蒂尔达\">玛蒂尔达</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.8</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>多焦点舞台</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：304104</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">很难说具体是什么吸引了我们优秀的纪律辅员。<br />也许是外勤专属的制服裙和纪念品，它们很适合装扮一次忙里偷闲。可能是帆船派对和扭扭舞会，人总会被反复的热情邀请激起好奇心。又或者在一次全新的临时任务里，作为基金会的一员自然义不容辞。<br />当然，让我们的调查员小姐全身心投入的，无疑是调查对象本身。浓郁的芝士，柔嫩的蘑菇，醇厚的萨拉米——哪怕是对美食精益求精的法兰西人，也不得不认可如此杰作。<br />“作为光荣的罗马后裔，做出这种程度的美食，也……也是理所当然的嘛！”</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"304104\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304108.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/16/Belonging-304108.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">丝巾手包<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Satin Handbag</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />11<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>派对举办方为特邀宾客发放的纪念品。<br />年轻的调查员执行小小外勤的时候，正需要一个成熟可靠的手包，用于妥善收纳基金会证件、通讯设备，以及她的孩子气。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304107.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/2a/Belonging-304107.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">派对定制手套<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">White Gloves</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>常规款白手套经由烤漆饰钉点缀，一切如同平淡的日常勤务中偶然寻获一份美味。<br />鉴于它对隔绝芝士和橄榄油的事业作出了卓著贡献，派对结束后理应隆重地享受一个“清理一新”。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304109.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c3/Belonging-304109.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">素绉缎手打领结<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Crepe Back Satin Cravat</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />20<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>色泽细腻的手打领结，几乎比佩戴者还要光彩照人。<br />出门前，布翁尼小姐花费了20分钟用一根金质领针将蝴蝶结尾翼固定住，以便在与海风、烘奶酪和热情过头的朋友相处整整一天之后，它仍能保持完美的对称形态。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">尝鲜调查员 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Great Taste Investigator</small></span></span>"}}